menu "Kiosk registration"

    config NET_PROVISION_API_URL
        string "API the kiosk asks for its ticket"
        default "https://api.cckiosk.io.vn"
        help
            Base of POST /devices/register and GET /devices/me (KEHOACH 7.3).
            Its certificate chains to a public root, so the IDF bundle is
            what trusts it, not the broker's own CA.

    config NET_PROVISION_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN
        string "Batch token the kiosk registers with"
        default ""
        help
            The DEVICE_BOOTSTRAP_TOKEN of api (KEHOACH 7.3). Never set here:
            it arrives from firmware/sdkconfig.secrets, which git ignores.
            Empty means this build never registers.

    config NET_PROVISION_WAIT_MIN_S
        int "First wait between asks, in seconds"
        default 10
        range 5 600

    config NET_PROVISION_WAIT_MAX_S
        int "Longest wait between asks, in seconds"
        default 300
        range 30 3600

    config NET_PROVISION_POLL_FLOOR_S
        int "Fastest pace a pending kiosk accepts from the server, in seconds"
        default 2
        range 1 60
        help
            The 202 names how often to ask (KEHOACH 7.3); a server that
            says 0 is held to this rather than asked in a tight loop.

    config NET_PROVISION_RENEW_BEFORE_DAYS
        int "Days before the ticket's exp at which the kiosk renews it"
        default 7
        range 1 30
        help
            Must stay well under DEVICE_TOKEN_TTL_DAYS of api, or a fresh
            ticket is due again the moment it lands (KEHOACH 7.3).

endmenu
